         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Amazon.com Inc. application, center, is displayed on an Apple Inc. iPhone in Washington, D.C., U.S., on Wednesday, Oct. 23, 2013. Amazon.com Inc. is scheduled to release third-quarter earnings on Oct. 24. Photographer: Andrew Harrer/Bloomberg</rdf:li>
